        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We participate in a competitive market for talent and aim to distinguish ourselves by offering our employees the opportunity to make a meaningful positive impact on the financial success of Americans in an innovative technology-oriented environment.",
        "start_character": 48577,
        "end_character": 48826
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001409970-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001409970-26-000018-db8559bc2eef4711",
        "accession_number": "0001409970-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Finally, as a digital marketplace bank without the typical brick-and-mortar branch network and related infrastructure of traditional banks, we are better able to leverage technology to meet customers where they are and provide them with smart, simple, and rewarding solutions.",
        "start_character": 9542,
        "end_character": 9818
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001409970-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001409970-26-000018-db8559bc2eef4711",
        "accession_number": "0001409970-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Loans we sell through our marketplace can offer duration, geographic, and/or asset diversification to these investors.",
        "start_character": 13253,
        "end_character": 13371
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001409970-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001409970-26-000018-db8559bc2eef4711",
        "accession_number": "0001409970-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We expect this trend of state-level activity in those areas to continue and are monitoring developments in the states in which our customers are located.",
        "start_character": 40301,
        "end_character": 40454
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001409970-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001409970-26-000018-db8559bc2eef4711",
        "accession_number": "0001409970-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We support our employees professionally through onboarding programs, on-the-job training, career development sessions and performance check-ins.",
        "start_character": 49584,
        "end_character": 49728
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001409970-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001409970-26-000018-db8559bc2eef4711",
        "accession_number": "0001409970-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "As a digital marketplace bank, we have key business model and competitive advantages over both traditional banks and fintech marketplaces.",
        "start_character": 8653,
        "end_character": 8791
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001409970-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001409970-26-000018-db8559bc2eef4711",
        "accession_number": "0001409970-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are able to help members refinance their higher-cost debt into a lower-cost, fixed-rate product, thereby providing both interest expense savings and a pathway toward an improved financial position.",
        "start_character": 11650,
        "end_character": 11850
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001409970-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001409970-26-000018-db8559bc2eef4711",
        "accession_number": "0001409970-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are subject to a broad array of federal, state and local laws and regulations that govern almost every aspect of our business relationships with consumers.",
        "start_character": 34559,
        "end_character": 34717
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001409970-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001409970-26-000018-db8559bc2eef4711",
        "accession_number": "0001409970-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "As a result of our data advantage and iterative credit modeling, third-party data shows that we are able to assess credit risk more effectively than traditional scoring models and our peer set, which allows us to expand access to credit and generate savings for members while also generating competitive risk-adjusted returns.",
        "start_character": 10620,
        "end_character": 10946
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001409970-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001409970-26-000018-db8559bc2eef4711",
        "accession_number": "0001409970-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Further, by applying the fair value option to HFI loans, we are applying the same accounting methodology to all loans we originate after January 1, 2026, as both HFI and HFS loans will be measured at fair value.",
        "start_character": 19303,
        "end_character": 19514
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001409970-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001409970-26-000018-db8559bc2eef4711",
        "accession_number": "0001409970-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "However, from time to time, we also enter into agreements with marketplace investors that outline terms of conditions pursuant to which multiple loan sales occur over an extended period of time.",
        "start_character": 7829,
        "end_character": 8023
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001409970-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001409970-26-000018-db8559bc2eef4711",
        "accession_number": "0001409970-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Our common stock is listed on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) under the trading symbol “LC” and therefore we are also subject to the rules of the NYSE for listed companies.",
        "start_character": 24446,
        "end_character": 24621
      }
